        rdfs:label "Asteroxylon mackiei Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 5.2 µm (Pass 1) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Module docstring names the kinetics and k_c. Lean 4 Loop_3124 proves the diffusion-ratio threshold, the 30-mode count, the >50× separation from the 283.4 µm sibling, and the negative trace, with no sorry." ;
